<title>USA: Dayton Hudson Corp Q4 Feb 1 oper net up.</title>
<headline>Dayton Hudson Corp Q4 Feb 1 oper net up.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		     1996</p>
<p> Oper shr diluted	 $1.27		    $0.98</p>
<p> Oper net		 296,000		  228,000</p>
<p> Revs		   8,167,000		7,950,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     219,400		  217,100</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     231,000		  229,300</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Latest Q4 results exclude charges totaling $0.36 a share. Including charges, latest Q4 income $214.0 million or $0.95 a share primary and $0.91 fully diluted.  </p>
<p>Q4 latest year charges include $134.0 million or $0.35 a share for real estate repositioning and $1.0 million or $0.01 a share for redemption of debt.</p>
<p>			YEAR</p>
<p> Oper shr diluted	 $2.35		    $1.30</p>
<p> Oper net		 555,000		  311,000</p>
<p> Revs		  25,371,000	     23,516,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     218,700		  216,800</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     230,600		  229,200</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full latest year net excludes charges of $134.0 million or $0.35 a share for real estate repositions and $11.0 million or $0.05 for debt redemption.  Including charges, full-year net income was $463.0 million or $2.02 a share primary and $1.95 fully diluted.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
